-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party tools and data this harness drives, none of it vendored
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no third-party source code or binaries. It pins
and invokes, by version, package version, source commit or file digest
(see pins/), tools and corpora that a user installs separately under their
own licenses:

  * aurora-lint (Apache-2.0), built from a pinned commit.
  * Cppcheck (GPL-3.0), clang-tidy (Apache-2.0 with LLVM exceptions),
    Infer (MIT) and Frama-C (LGPL-2.1), each installed from its own
    distribution channel; this harness only runs them.
  * The Juliet Test Suite for C/C++ (public domain, NIST SARD) and the
    open-source C codebases named in pins/corpus.json, each cloned at a
    pinned commit under its own license.

